description = For older players (cartoon horror and combat). Night after night the corrupted elves come out of the woods for the barricade. Aim and shoot with nine winter weapons, from the Icicle Pistol to the Sleigh-Bell Gatling; by day spend twelve hours on repairs, searching for weapons, ammunition and survivors, and training. A weather radio tells each night's weather: clear, fog (only what Rudolf's glowing nose lights is seen), blizzard, and once a full moon, when everything runs and a wendigo comes. Hold out for twenty-five nights, through the great blizzard. Mouse, keyboard, controller or touch. Made for Rudolf OS.
